#: ../../source/docs/filesystems.rst:5 b4480a70cfed41c5bbd4833fba18e973
msgid "ArduPilot File Systems"
msgstr "ArduPilot 文件系统"

#: ../../source/docs/filesystems.rst:7 7fbd0c0bc8b0453f8ee18e4772b1db77
msgid ""
"ArduPilot uses several files systems to store and retrieve data from non-"
"volatile storage using either external SD cards or autopilot flash memory."
msgstr "ArduPilot 使用多种文件系统，通过外部 SD 卡或自动驾驶仪闪存从非易失性存储中存取数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/filesystems.rst:10 f697584700684ca6aa314bac54152d76
msgid "External SD Card"
msgstr "外部 SD 卡"

#: ../../source/docs/filesystems.rst:12 be97dc5a991040118dcb195d9c9ede80
msgid "The directory structure is:"
msgstr "目录结构如下："

#: ../../source/docs/filesystems.rst:18 7870db4a853149658a92eee9707cd646
msgid "APM: base directory"
msgstr "APM：根目录"

#: ../../source/docs/filesystems.rst:19 091720eb325c46919254d807dbc3d908
msgid ""
"LOGS : flight logs are stored here (See :ref:`common-downloading-and-"
"analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner`)"
msgstr ""
"LOGS：飞行日志存储于此（参见 :ref:`common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-"
"mission-planner`）"

#: ../../source/docs/filesystems.rst:20 39cfa1deb9ab46f39debf2e11f6985d2
msgid ""
"TERRAIN : terrain data is stored here (See :ref:`common-terrain-following`)"
msgstr "TERRAIN：地形数据存储于此（参见 :ref:`common-terrain-following`）"

#: ../../source/docs/filesystems.rst:21 79874a1d5ee54f7ca4cbca98975d8ce0
msgid "STRNG_BAK: every boot the parameter data is backed up here"
msgstr "STRNG_BAK：每次启动时，参数数据都会备份至此处"

#: ../../source/docs/filesystems.rst:22 5259c7575151447fb77fcb67fed62a29
msgid "scripts: LUA scripts are stored here (See :ref:`common-lua-scripts`)"
msgstr "scripts：LUA 脚本存储于此（参见 :ref:`common-lua-scripts`）"

#: ../../source/docs/filesystems.rst:24 1d6b23e2ccd24d798e7962381ad74819
msgid ""
"and a vehicle backup file (one for each vehicle class that the card has been"
" used) that contains **???**"
msgstr "以及每种飞行器类型（该 SD 卡曾用过的每种机型各一个）的飞行器备份文件，其中包含 **???**"

#: ../../source/docs/filesystems.rst:27 4e4401e5527c4965951bbf43c6d09659
msgid "Flash based virtual file systems"
msgstr "基于 Flash 的虚拟文件系统"

#: ../../source/docs/filesystems.rst:29 7370b941dbaa4e34a685dde67dd975d7
msgid ""
"Several flash based file systems are setup. Most are for internal, ground "
"station, or developer use only, but one is useful for normal users."
msgstr "设置了多个基于 Flash 的文件系统。其中大多数仅供内部、地面站或开发人员使用，但有一个对普通用户也有用。"

#: ../../source/docs/filesystems.rst:31 4ae38a196f684f0db5891dd3053c5923
msgid ""
"@ROMFS: this contains a copy of the bootloader version created with the "
"firmware that is loaded which is used if a bootloader update is commanded "
"from an attached ground station or pc utility. It also contains a copy of "
"the hardware definition file, and font files if OSD support is included."
msgstr ""
"@ROMFS：包含随所加载固件一同创建的 bootloader 版本副本，当连接的地面站或 PC 工具发出 bootloader "
"更新命令时使用。它还包含硬件定义文件副本，以及（如支持 OSD）字体文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/filesystems.rst:32 b96a21c363a14f93b6294e79575b8eb4
msgid ""
"@PARAM: this is a packed version of the firmware's parameters which can be "
"downloaded from the ground control station."
msgstr "@PARAM：这是固件参数的压缩版本，可从地面控制站下载。"

#: ../../source/docs/filesystems.rst:38 c7e19b97f28a4a01a6a6dc2f95fc98e0
msgid ""
"@SYS: which contains several text files that keep statistics of internal "
"operational processes for information and debugging issues (really the only "
"one a normal user may be asked to access to send information when debugging "
"a user issue):"
msgstr ""
"@SYS：包含若干文本文件，记录内部运行过程的统计信息，用于信息查阅和调试问题（实际上是普通用户在调试问题时可能被要求访问并发送信息的唯一目录）："

#: ../../source/docs/filesystems.rst:34 ce812b7bd7f248d1bf1814fc4339ea0e
msgid ""
"threads.text: information on the concurrent process threads during operation"
msgstr "threads.text：运行期间并发进程线程的相关信息"

